      "rationale": "bug-analysis.md validated 30/30 by bug_analysis_validator at status provisional. Severity critical and reproducibility deterministic are both evidenced: reproducibility is established against this run's own transition log, which records triage-and-impact moving blocked to pending when the operator correction landed. Blast radius widened on evidence from one phase to six, and the analysis correctly withholds the root cause because no specification states which reading the Output Artifact column owes; Q-001 routes that to architect and root-cause-analysis closes it. omn-dev-1-bug-analyst produced this and is excluded from deciding under the Producer Exclusion Rule.",
