      "rationale": "implementation-report.md validated 32/32 by implementation_report_validator, side effects declared only. Attempt 1 was refused for a policy-failure the check was right to raise: the agent declared two writes under runs/**, which its own manifest excludes so that a change cannot rewrite the evidence assessing it. Root cause was the operator's dispatch instruction requiring a verifier that mutates the run store; cleared by recorded policy exception, and attempt 2 wrote no run-store path, proven by digesting all 213 files under runs/ before and after. The two regressions the operator identified are closed at their cause and independently re-measured: V4 by expressing the bug-analysis mutation as a derivation so it survives a real run artifact, M6 by replaying the append-only transition log through the existing GD-001 helpers rather than adding a third reconstruction. Both repairs were checked for decisiveness. Scope boundary held: the column contract and the five prose rows are untouched and stay escalated as V-001.",
